# Teyo, Lightshield Expert: "target permanent you control gains hexproof until end of turn. Put a +1/+1 counter on it
# if it's a creature" (CR 608.2c). Bot1 casts Teyo with a Plains and a Mox Pearl and chooses its Ornithopter, which has
# hexproof and a counter: 1/3. Teyo has flash, so the pass after the Ornithopter is cast lets it resolve first.

